      <!-- 1. Purpose of Foundation -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">1. Organizational Purpose & Scope</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          The Connecting Hearts Foundation provides safe community spaces, free and subsidized counseling referrals, relationship education, and child academic support in Warri, Delta State, and across Nigeria. Our platform is dedicated to promoting healthy family dynamics, emotional healing, and child welfare.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Non-Emergency Disclaimer -->
      <div class="space-y-3 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-amber-950">2. Medical & Emergency Services Disclaimer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Connecting Hearts Foundation is NOT an emergency crisis intervention centre or medical healthcare provider. Our counseling services provide supportive relationship guidance and referral network access. If you or someone you know is facing immediate physical danger, severe psychiatric crisis, or self-harm, please contact local emergency medical services or security authorities immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Conference & Event Registrations -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">3. Connecting Hearts Experience Events</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Registration for the Connecting Hearts Experience conference editions (including future launch events in Warri) is subject to availability and event guidelines. Attendees are expected to maintain respectful, non-judgmental, and constructive decorum toward fellow participants and speakers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Counseling Intake & Responsibility -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">4. Support Intake & Counseling Requests</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          Submitting a request for counseling or educational support does not guarantee instant session assignment. Requests are evaluated based on urgency, capacity, and appropriate matching with qualified family counselors or partner schools.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Donations & Financial Transparency -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">5. Financial Contributions & Sponsorships</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-charcoal-700">
          All financial donations made to Connecting Hearts Foundation are deployed strictly toward specified Foundation pillars, including child tuition payments, therapy session subsidies, and conference hosting in Delta State. Donations are non-refundable once processed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Intellectual Property -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-plum-900">6. Intellectual Property</h3>
